5. KEEP YOUR LICENSED VERSIONS; UPDATE ACCESS LASTS ONE YEAR

5.1 The paid usage grant is perpetual for eligible versions within its scope,
    subject to compliance and Section 10. You are not required to renew merely
    to continue using those versions. Expiry of an update period or a temporary
