5.7 Retirement does not waive obligations already owed for an unexpired paid
    access period. The Licensor will provide the available eligible versions
    through a reasonable alternative delivery method where practicable. If a
    separately owed paid service cannot be supplied, appropriate remedies,
    including any proportionate refund required by the accepted order or
